831
00:34:07,367 --> 00:34:11,667
- [Mike] I had the popular Jerry
Orbach hairstyle back then.

832
00:34:11,667 --> 00:34:12,600
- [McCreedy voiceover]
It was right

833
00:34:12,600 --> 00:34:14,300
