I didn't move.

846
00:34:41,833 --> 00:34:43,833
I just kept watching it.

847
00:34:45,267 --> 00:34:46,700
- [Servo] Yep, yep, that's
true, that's what happened.

848
00:34:46,700 --> 00:34:49,500
Yep, yep, uh huh, uh
huh, yep yep yep, uh huh.

849
00:34:49,500 --> 00:34:51,267
